{"id":"f467f3c94be8e7be","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure.md","title":"ZFC Forcing8 Strategic Closure","display":"df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure — ZFC Forcing8 Strategic Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure — ZFC Forcing8 Strategic Closure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing8-strategic-closure — ZFC Forcing8 Strategic Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,1_P\">\\(P,\\leq_P,1_P\\)</span> (forcing poset, order, and top condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (ordinal length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\kappa\\to\\{\\mathrm{Incomplete},\\mathrm{Complete}\\}\">\\(c:\\kappa\\to\\{\\mathrm{Incomplete},\\mathrm{Complete}\\}\\)</span> (turn schedule, alternating at successors and assigning limit turns to Complete)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> (strategy assigning a common lower condition to every legal history at a Complete turn)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8StrategicClosure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8StrategicClosure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}strategic\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8StrategicClosure}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\kappa,c)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land c:\\kappa\\to\\{\\mathrm{Incomplete},\\mathrm{Complete}\\}\\\\&amp;\\land c(0)=\\mathrm{Incomplete}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(\\xi+1\\in\\kappa\\to c(\\xi+1)\\neq c(\\xi))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to c(\\lambda)=\\mathrm{Complete})\\\\&amp;\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma:\\{h\\in V:\\exists\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;(h:\\delta\\to P\\land c(\\delta)=\\mathrm{Complete}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\delta\\;h(\\eta)\\leq_Ph(\\xi))\\}\\to P\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\;(\\sigma(h)\\leq_Ph(\\xi))\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}strategic\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8StrategicClosure}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\kappa,c)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land c:\\kappa\\to\\{\\mathrm{Incomplete},\\mathrm{Complete}\\}\\\\&amp;\\land c(0)=\\mathrm{Incomplete}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(\\xi+1\\in\\kappa\\to c(\\xi+1)\\neq c(\\xi))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to c(\\lambda)=\\mathrm{Complete})\\\\&amp;\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma:\\{h\\in V:\\exists\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;(h:\\delta\\to P\\land c(\\delta)=\\mathrm{Complete}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\delta\\;h(\\eta)\\leq_Ph(\\xi))\\}\\to P\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\forall\\xi\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\;(\\sigma(h)\\leq_Ph(\\xi))\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The turn schedule and strategy graph are explicit; the former nonexistent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Win}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Win}_S\\)</span> primitive has been replaced by the actual lower-bound response condition on legal histories.</li>\n<li>The forcing order and top condition are parameters of both the predicate and the closure game; the carrier alone does not determine legal descending moves.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Rema